  {"id":"math-q-11","subject":"math","level":"Qiyin","topic":"Algebra","question":"Agar f(x) = 3x² - 2 bo'lsa, f(3) nechaga teng?","options":["25","27","7","16"],"correctAnswer":"25","explanation":"f(3) = 3×(3²) - 2 = 3×9 - 2 = 27 - 2 = 25."},
  {"id":"math-q-12","subject":"math","level":"Qiyin","topic":"Arifmetika","question":"1 dan 20 gacha bo'lgan barcha natural sonlar yig'indisi nechaga teng?","options":["210","200","190","220"],"correctAnswer":"210","explanation":"Formula: n(n+1)/2 = 20 × 21 / 2 = 210."},
